{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "987689c04662ba69181f2d8454eb7cb97e19060d802d7d4b23c5407bc5397243", "ja": "（いよいよ、紬の初ステージだ。本番直前だが……\nバックステージに紬の姿がないな。探しに行こう）", "zh": "（䌷终于要首次登台了。正式演出就快开始……\n后台却不见䌷的踪影，去找她吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "eb5aa964e249a94c59247f1597a6ac60e45f11dd9a4df9fe968c6510e1a47df8", "ja": "…………。\nはぁ……。", "zh": "…………\n唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "273509faa6bf17d5a047d756848a9a2330de574eedd19a04eefcf718041cd56b", "ja": "あっ……{$P$}。\nあの、私……。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}。\n那个，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b8e24cc947911316d4bee93023a4bf18e4aaeeeefc7ea6cdad9294cabdef7e40", "ja": "いよいよだな、紬。\nもしかして、緊張してるのか？", "zh": "公演终于要开始了，䌷。\n你该不会很紧张吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ae1578781708eeef3a2c7f6981d1b0f94b09302efbca4718a3adaebf718ee6f7", "ja": "…………。\n聞かないとわからないとは驚きました。", "zh": "…………\n这种事情居然还要问，太令人吃惊了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ad27872be8aebd72804e11d0bb96e89772c858f28e069485d9d48211f5df20d1", "ja": "{$P$}は私のことを、この状況でも\n緊張しない、豪胆無比の豪傑とでもお思いなのですか？", "zh": "{$P$}，你以为我是在这种情况下\n还能处之泰然、浑身是胆的豪杰吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c5b1309ee152ccbeddd4ab926ec04c1bc361de663fde9dac24073fa95e2b06e3", "ja": "い、いや、そういうわけじゃないんだ。\nちょっと確認したまでで。", "zh": "误、误会，我当然不这么觉得。\n只是想确认一下而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "888b7379fc1d922868b4861cbb6842ac8ba0a19e75a5bb0a978d1ca5e11a482d", "ja": "よかった……。貴方は時々恐ろしいほど鈍感なご様子\nなので、もしかしたらと……心配になりました。", "zh": "很好……因为你有时真的迟钝到令人捏把冷汗，\n我还以为……看来是我多心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "41ac649495be214712e8d3f01a0a59584a8a4a53a6ef0523be648289b0e8ec3c", "ja": "とはいえ、ではあなたの目に私がどう映っているのか、\n知る由もないのですけれど……。", "zh": "不过，这样我就不知道\n自己在你的眼里是什么样子了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7ecd87f4f1be3559af14200de090f4553bfa2cdcd16b9e0513ffbdf034ebbfff", "ja": "つまるところ、私は、普通の……お、女の子ですから。\n人並みに緊張くらい……します。", "zh": "总而言之，我是个普通的……女、女孩子。\n当然也会像其他人一样……紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b0804a98f42214959854538f17bdcd544c80c9edc7e690106d4cdbd550393df1", "ja": "わかってるよ。初舞台なんだし、\n緊張しない方が珍しいんだ。大丈夫！", "zh": "我知道。毕竟这是你首次登台，\n不紧张才奇怪。放心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f34e500170898d786b4674371bb4c7e3d8bbe7e1ba7be3ad6edb476e5045613b", "ja": "遠慮なく、思いきり緊張したまま、\nステージにぶつかって来い！", "zh": "不用顾虑，硬着头皮上场，\n尽情地表演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6bf3562406a39940b5861d8a15d4d8eae925e90566db34d02c24a1bdb809198a", "ja": "あなたは、もしかして……一応それなりに考えて\nいそうに見えて、何ひとつ考えていないのですか？", "zh": "莫非你……虽然看起来像是多少有动点脑筋，\n但其实根本没经过大脑思考吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3a5bb499be2fdefc7969f1036ac5c874fbd3ea88f8ac4c8cb6ded36d3f4f108b", "ja": "未熟で無様なステージをお見せするなんて、\nそれではお客さま方の期待を裏切ることになります。", "zh": "居然要我登台呈现生涩又难堪的表演，\n这样子会辜负观众期待的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b4bf9d71c00d31d4897c9e963dc11bd9bc6a79d2a3dbde4caf6c768a0eb4f9f0", "ja": "それに、劇場のみんなにも……。\n迷惑……。", "zh": "而且，还会造成剧场其他伙伴的……\n困扰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_1016", "source_sha256": "569f2d21da61db3053a717afd79fdf017bb7fa8d58ab88b5b51ac2e077c83110", "ja": "大丈夫", "zh": "放心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "2c2a68ff42ed84de33199abdb8c78410726ef12eb36fdc034f12fb6e850efa64", "ja": "大丈夫、失敗しないアイドルなんていないよ。\n緊張しない方が珍しいって言っただろ？", "zh": "放心，偶像都会经历失败。\n我不是也说过，不紧张才奇怪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2001_p", "source_sha256": "4b9170737b4be09ccae6c46d54dabe9e0331c53d21b4d6a63063f3055827ac68", "ja": "つまり、みんな緊張してるんだ。今の紬と同じように、\n失敗したらどうしようって思ってる。", "zh": "换句话说，大家都会紧张。就跟现在的䌷一样，\n烦恼着如果失败了该如何是好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5e2a4ac44814363c47ecacad660583ef00613e4d29ea50588ea7d89d8c7d6a8a", "ja": "…………。\nそれがわかっていて、その態度……。", "zh": "…………\n你明明心知肚明，却是这种态度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1a2c13cf74686a224150b4770d09eaed1517742679bfcbabffa0105fc2b9202c", "ja": "貴方という方は、いったいどこまで鉄面皮なのですか？\n貴方はそれでも人ですか？", "zh": "你这个人到底有多么厚脸皮？\n这样还算是个人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2004_p", "source_sha256": "16f4ca8b4455b7867dfa32879e09ff343b321d516494c53f7c3f12f3da5a6491", "ja": "い、いや、別に突き放して言ってるわけじゃないぞ。\nみんな同じだって言ってるんだ。", "zh": "你、你误会了，我不是要弃你于不顾。\n我只是想表达大家都是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2005_p", "source_sha256": "6324b3692507ba1afe83cd6ee57e77e3c9449cc1c651f40481027475941aae35", "ja": "みんな一緒に緊張して……、もしかしたら、\n一緒に失敗するかもしれないな。", "zh": "大家一起紧张……搞不好，\n还可能会一起失败。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d95ee1298382f01e54f6f14ef02b9bf32dcf68f2fa16793e75b47cb25ad00432", "ja": "そ、そんなこと……。\n思っても、口に出して言わないでください！", "zh": "这、这种话……\n在心里想就算了，请不要说出口！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2007_p", "source_sha256": "a4c456b187bf8aa7cede1bd5222c4deb39109fc41ee4b3a275960ba3d1db0d98", "ja": "でも、初舞台っていうのはそういうものだよ。\n最初から完ぺきなアイドルなんて、どこにもいない。", "zh": "但是，首次登台就是这样啊。\n没有一个偶像一开始就是完美的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2008_p", "source_sha256": "049dc2e24baa6017528fcacf709ad73aec80f8fc497b8e204c49d2fa184f40f5", "ja": "だからこそ、最初から上手くできたら、\nとびきり嬉しいんだろうな。……そう思わないか？", "zh": "正因为如此，如果初次登台还算顺利，\n也就特别令人开心……不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b4182d23e0196a62c5e8abf719c917903332a79859c775f1d142d038ed639ff4", "ja": "貴方という方は……。\nどこまでも気楽な性質で、うらやましいことです。", "zh": "你这个人……\n总是如此地乐观，真令人羡慕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b90e9cd68696a561267e83ef80d5ca371808267e98d1ccdd3ed7ca4e9683ae50", "ja": "でも、きっと、そんな貴方だからでしょうか……。", "zh": "不过，或许也因为有你这样的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "db528d4e48a99b4c3be04d97dba1fb142f2546852b8a267bde428cd3d7dcfc23", "ja": "話してるうちに、心配するのが\nバカらしくなってしまいました……。ふふっ！", "zh": "和你聊着聊着，\n让我觉得自己担心就像笨蛋一样……呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2013_p", "source_sha256": "bbc1fcd8314b63291d244d5e5b2257f8e1db6e319465ed9eb6f3ffae90a6965f", "ja": "よし、いい顔になった。いけそうか？", "zh": "很好，你的表情舒缓许多了。没问题了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4b62fc9b18df16729081ebc52fda8353dbe64272e6806a128c08bc6bfc979730", "ja": "はい、おかげさまで、怒るのにも疲れましたし。\n肩の力もよい塩梅に抜けたようです。", "zh": "是的，拜你所赐，我也无力生气了。\n心情似乎也放松了不少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e767b93f09cf9a095497e52100a5a72673b8c830868f1e28c297ad51c5c65d8b", "ja": "それでは……。", "zh": "那么我要出发了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2016_p", "source_sha256": "d93b63c1a16c934ff7e45754b74ccf6d89627da2189d2e6fcbd5a5abc6187119", "ja": "ああ、いって来い！\n俺もちゃんと見てるからな！", "zh": "很好，上场吧！\n我也会在旁边看着的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b2d7598e2a853651ea5f784a2b2e7e267341c6aa72b4209f3e209de198d612e1", "ja": "担当アイドルのステージを見るのは、当然のことと\n思いますけど……まさか見ないつもりだったのですか？", "zh": "观看担当偶像的表演应该是理所当然的吧……\n难不成你本来不打算要看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2019_p", "source_sha256": "c5b1309ee152ccbeddd4ab926ec04c1bc361de663fde9dac24073fa95e2b06e3", "ja": "い、いや、そういうわけじゃないんだ。\nちょっと確認したまでで。", "zh": "误、误会，我不是那个意思。\n只是确认一下罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_003_2020_p", "source_sha256": "e98da5ba9b24ee01e3b32252b25c6f52d3711d8c571cc898a05f1fa236114acc", "ja": "とにかく、頑張ってこい！", "zh": "总之，表演加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
